    "intro": "If you soared through the sky last night, Korean tradition has some genuinely exciting news for you — but there's a twist that surprises almost everyone. For over a thousand years, Koreans have treated flying dreams as prophetic signals tied directly to real-world fortune, not merely as reflections of inner psychology. And buried inside this most auspicious of dream categories are a few patterns that carry the opposite warning entirely.",
