        "heading": "Neutral Signs — A Major Evaluation Is Coming",
        "content": "Dreaming of diligently preparing for an exam, or traveling to the exam venue, carries no strong fortune or misfortune — instead, it serves as a quiet harbinger that an important moment of evaluation or decision-making is approaching in your waking life. The dream is priming you, not warning you.\n\nWaking up anxious after failing to answer essay questions is a mixed, context-dependent sign. While it mirrors real-world anxiety, it may also foreshadow that the problem at hand will eventually resolve, bringing relief. The emotional tone of the dream — were you terrified, or vaguely unsettled? — is often the most important clue to its meaning."
