    "conclusion": "Exam dreams are among the most psychologically rich — and most misunderstood — dreams we have. They are rarely just about exams. Whether you sailed through the test or turned in a blank paper, whether you arrived with seconds to spare or missed the exam entirely, each scenario carries a specific message about how you relate to challenge, evaluation, and opportunity in your waking life. Korean tradition and modern psychology agree on one essential point: pay attention to the emotion, not just the plot. The feeling you carry out of the dream is the real signal."
