    "intro": "A fishing dream is one of the most warmly regarded omens in Korean folk tradition — it signals that opportunity, long prepared for, is finally moving toward you. For thousands of years, the patient act of casting a line and waiting has embodied the Confucian ideal: disciplined effort rewarded in its own time. But there is a crucial catch — whether the fish escapes or lands in your hands changes everything about what this dream is telling you.",
